{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 0, "text_idx": 20, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 69, "letters": 271, "chars": 358, "max_new_tokens": 607, "t_start": 1790292460.152, "latency": 9.883, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 933164, "out_tokens": "244", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "379", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "244", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "623", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "88", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 607}, "params": {}, "text": "So I get on this old airplane, they say it's a very important airplane, and I walk in, and the carpet, I'm telling you, the carpet was from nineteen seventy. Sticky. Your shoes stick to it. And there's a smell, I don't even want to describe the smell. Like old cheese and jet fuel. And they hand me a sandwich, it's wrapped in plastic, and the bread is gray.", "audio_s": 19.44, "rtf": 0.508, "s_per_word": 0.282, "s_per_letter": 0.0717, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.902, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "496182460d4e065e8f7701b8bfa631a90446acff5795e7ed49c45e43737f677d", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/000.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 1, "text_idx": 21, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 61, "letters": 249, "chars": 328, "max_new_tokens": 560, "t_start": 1790292460.154, "latency": 10.033, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 967724, "out_tokens": "253", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "373", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "253", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "626", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "82", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 560}, "params": {}, "text": "We did it! We won! Eighteenth hole, the whole club watching, I'm down by one stroke, and I hit the most beautiful shot of my life. The ball goes up, up, up, lands on the green, rolls, rolls, and goes right in! Right in the cup! Everybody went crazy! People were jumping, people were screaming, grown men were hugging each other!", "audio_s": 20.16, "rtf": 0.498, "s_per_word": 0.33, "s_per_letter": 0.081, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 1.018, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "4a33f67299972680d3e4c4f4cc61d414e3303f682da06fea63a16024f0c59868", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/001.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 2, "text_idx": 22, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 55, "letters": 222, "chars": 287, "max_new_tokens": 502, "t_start": 1790292460.155, "latency": 8.43, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 729644, "out_tokens": "191", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "360", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "191", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "551", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "69", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 502}, "params": {}, "text": "Folks, I have some tremendous news today. We are opening a brand new restaurant, and it's going to be the best burger restaurant in the history of burgers. The buns are going to be golden, the meat is going to be perfect, and the fries, oh, the fries are going to be crispy, very crispy.", "audio_s": 15.2, "rtf": 0.555, "s_per_word": 0.276, "s_per_letter": 0.0685, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.861, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "da0dd041871ea6e1334937eaf2b980a720ea6cdd6cd3b4204dd59c7d38eb4560", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/002.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 3, "text_idx": 23, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 62, "letters": 262, "chars": 340, "max_new_tokens": 588, "t_start": 1790292460.157, "latency": 8.612, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 752684, "out_tokens": "197", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "375", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "197", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "572", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "84", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 588}, "params": {}, "text": "We have the best chefs, the best recipes, and the prices are going to be very reasonable. Very reasonable. People are already lining up, and we haven't even opened. You're going to love it. You're going to come back again and again. It's going to be huge! And the milkshakes, the milkshakes are going to be so thick, you'll need two straws.", "audio_s": 15.68, "rtf": 0.549, "s_per_word": 0.253, "s_per_letter": 0.0598, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.753, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "355d751297ea35d49822f5e9b7664f90d4bebd98df27103fff77f0030e2579bd", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/003.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 4, "text_idx": 24, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 61, "letters": 210, "chars": 287, "max_new_tokens": 476, "t_start": 1790292460.159, "latency": 7.84, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 675884, "out_tokens": "177", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "369", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "177", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "546", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "78", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 476}, "params": {}, "text": "I'll tell you something most people don't know. I'm not a fan of sharks. Not a fan. A friend of mine takes me out on his boat, beautiful boat, and he says, let's go for a swim. And I look down into the water, and I see a fin. A big fin. And it's going around the boat, around and around.", "audio_s": 14.08, "rtf": 0.557, "s_per_word": 0.231, "s_per_letter": 0.067, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.843, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "50c25ca5e5ab204b0206cd4dcaf3e9c22ebbd3c45d90eb7d896b4dd7929c5361", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/004.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 5, "text_idx": 25, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 57, "letters": 220, "chars": 295, "max_new_tokens": 498, "t_start": 1790292460.161, "latency": 8.531, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 741164, "out_tokens": "194", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "367", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "194", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "561", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "76", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 498}, "params": {}, "text": "And my friend says, don't worry, it's friendly. Friendly? There's no such thing as a friendly shark! I stayed in the middle of the boat for three hours. Three hours! I didn't move. I'm telling you, never again. Now when I see the ocean, I look at it from the beach. From far away. Very far away.", "audio_s": 15.44, "rtf": 0.553, "s_per_word": 0.271, "s_per_letter": 0.0702, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.883, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "54259922410f74cf5001fb1c1a98ebd321bcb6d5a953a06c83f9560cb3644f3a", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/005.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 6, "text_idx": 26, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 55, "letters": 223, "chars": 294, "max_new_tokens": 504, "t_start": 1790292460.163, "latency": 9.112, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 791084, "out_tokens": "207", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "363", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "207", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "570", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "72", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 504}, "params": {}, "text": "So I get in the elevator in my own building, my own beautiful building, and it stops. Right between the floors. Just stops. I press the button, nothing. I press the alarm, nothing. I call my people, no signal. No signal, in my own building! And I'm standing there, and there's nothing I can do.", "audio_s": 16.48, "rtf": 0.553, "s_per_word": 0.3, "s_per_letter": 0.0739, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.93, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "d8fc3bd664d9186c448f4239648594389d1831511d43bfc8510fbe04b125932d", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/006.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 7, "text_idx": 27, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 57, "letters": 227, "chars": 297, "max_new_tokens": 513, "t_start": 1790292460.165, "latency": 9.066, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 779564, "out_tokens": "204", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "362", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "204", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "566", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "71", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 513}, "params": {}, "text": "Nothing. I've made the biggest deals in the world, and I can't make a little elevator go up one floor. So I just stood there, and I waited, and I waited. Forty minutes. There was nothing anyone could do. When the doors finally opened, I just walked out, very quietly. I took the stairs for a week.", "audio_s": 16.24, "rtf": 0.558, "s_per_word": 0.285, "s_per_letter": 0.0715, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.9, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "dbfb08d617931187b10a627afe3755acbf3c95df437989b423867d294da141ca", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/007.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 8, "text_idx": 28, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 58, "letters": 210, "chars": 281, "max_new_tokens": 476, "t_start": 1790292460.167, "latency": 8.114, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 691244, "out_tokens": "181", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "363", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "181", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "544", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "72", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 476}, "params": {}, "text": "I miss the old days, I really do. When I was starting out, there was this little diner on the corner, and they made the best burger I ever had. Every Saturday I'd go there, sit at the counter, and the old man would say, the usual? And I'd say, the usual. It closed a long time ago.", "audio_s": 14.4, "rtf": 0.563, "s_per_word": 0.248, "s_per_letter": 0.0686, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.863, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "e788214ba444987cfaf971711ef1d95871c270f5b0f4eef5b48710862549aa6a", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/008.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 9, "text_idx": 29, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 59, "letters": 225, "chars": 295, "max_new_tokens": 508, "t_start": 1790292460.169, "latency": 9.546, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 860204, "out_tokens": "225", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "362", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "225", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "587", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "71", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 508}, "params": {}, "text": "They built a bank there, a boring bank. And I've eaten in the finest restaurants in the world since then, the finest. But I would give a lot, a lot, to sit at that counter one more time. Just one more time. Sometimes I still drive past that corner. I look at the bank, and I remember the burger.", "audio_s": 17.92, "rtf": 0.533, "s_per_word": 0.304, "s_per_letter": 0.0796, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 1.002, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "4dbb045da88156839d20674be6d98bc033255f8455b9046baecdfda1241e84d6", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/009.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 10, "text_idx": 30, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 64, "letters": 251, "chars": 331, "max_new_tokens": 564, "t_start": 1790292460.17, "latency": 9.868, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 925484, "out_tokens": "242", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "372", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "242", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "614", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "81", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 564}, "params": {}, "text": "Look at this building. Look at it. Fifty eight floors of the finest glass, the finest marble, the finest everything. When I started, people laughed at me. They said, you'll never do it, kid. And I did it. I built it. My name is right there on the front, in gold letters, big gold letters, and you can see it from three blocks away.", "audio_s": 19.28, "rtf": 0.512, "s_per_word": 0.301, "s_per_letter": 0.0768, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.966, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "c600a4674d258aaba7d89570c890ae11d64f5467caa8fa258f4b47ff02936a65", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/010.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 16, "idx": 11, "text_idx": 31, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 55, "letters": 234, "chars": 302, "max_new_tokens": 528, "t_start": 1790292460.172, "latency": 9.101, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 779564, "out_tokens": "204", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "360", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "204", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "564", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "69", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 528}, "params": {}, "text": "People come from all over the world just to take a picture of it. And I tell them, go ahead, take the picture. Take two. It's the most beautiful building in the city, and everybody knows it. And inside, the lobby, the waterfall, the beautiful pink marble. There's nothing like it anywhere in the world.", "audio_s": 16.24, "rtf": 0.56, "s_per_word": 0.295, "s_per_letter": 0.0694, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.873, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "be10a8bacecd61a5e439cc96793a22deca6d2a586719e22897686b6f2770201a", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/011.wav"}
